{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203410","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203410","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1320341001:1":{"text":"你们这群混账……居然打伤了我这么多佣兵！这可都是要赔钱的！！","source_cn":"你们这群混账……居然打伤了我这么多佣兵！这可都是要赔钱的！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBB7010E8F965A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320341002:1":{"text":"左邻右舍都来瞧瞧，这就是老叶甫根尼和列夫斯基的行事作风！不仅欠钱不还，还打人！","source_cn":"左邻右舍都来瞧瞧，这就是老叶甫根尼和列夫斯基的行事作风...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84DCC26C9EEFD993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320341003:1":{"text":"什么啊？！明明是你先动的手！","source_cn":"什么啊？！明明是你先动的手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A68D3765D44A0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320341004:1":{"text":"得了吧！你们说说列夫斯基这个人，从前自诩清高，满嘴都是什么乱七八糟的艺术，天天追在贵族老爷们后面阿谀奉承！","source_cn":"得了吧！你们说说列夫斯基这个人，从前自诩清高，满嘴都是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67863B5563304931","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320341005:1":{"text":"他病倒之后，那些老爷可没一个过来探望的，只有我们这些好心人愿意借钱给他！可现在他死了，他父亲老叶甫根尼竟然不肯还钱！","source_cn":"他病倒之后，那些老爷可没一个过来探望的，只有我们这些好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9C8DA14FD44919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320341006:1":{"text":"要我说啊，他得的病就是神明的惩罚！！","source_cn":"要我说啊，他得的病就是神明的惩罚！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F8EDCEB73991541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320341007:1":{"text":"你……你瞎说什么！！","source_cn":"你……你瞎说什么！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16CE0900C2983E8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320341008:1":{"text":"哼，老叶甫根尼，我劝你早点认命。这些多管闲事的人早晚要走，你可跑不掉。","source_cn":"哼，老叶甫根尼，我劝你早点认命。这些多管闲事的人早晚要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89D1E6C450052C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320341009:1":{"text":"可别惹急了我，不然我真对你动——","source_cn":"可别惹急了我，不然我真对你动——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F552962FD71202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320341010:1":{"text":"你刚才说，“生病是神明的惩罚”？","source_cn":"你刚才说，“生病是神明的惩罚”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA698600D74CAF22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320341011:1":{"text":"这句话是什么意思？我不太理解，想请你解释